OL,3,GNEWSATrophy disappears during black
OL,4,Apudding contest
OL,5,
OL,6,FCelebrations for the official Black
OL,7,FPudding Throwing Championships were
OL,8,F"subdued" after the trophy went missing
OL,9,Fduring the event, organisers have said.
OL,11,FJune Weir, 73, from Wilpshire,
OL,12,FLancashire, won the annual event at The
OL,13,FOak pub in Ramsbottom, Bury, on Sunday,
OL,14,Fbecoming the first female champion in
OL,15,Fits 100-year history.
OL,17,FOrganiser Paul Jenkins said the
OL,18,Fpresentation "lacked its sparkle" after
OL,19,Fthe trophy disappeared from the prize
OL,20,Ftable between 11:40 and 13:30 BST.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
